# .roadmap.hypothesis mk1 — anima 가설 진행 SSOT (C 도메인)
# 2026-05-06 — 가설 cycle (pre-register → run → verdict → falsified/supported) archive + 탐색 method + 검증 method
# Sister roadmaps: .roadmap.philosophy (A) .roadmap.law (B) .roadmap.cli .roadmap.clm_native_chat
# Scope: anima의 가설 진행 archive — 우주/생명/의식의 근원적 물음 + 도덕/가치 (선 vs 악) + 물리/수학/생명/의식 도메인 가설 등 anima가 진행하는 모든 hypothesis 항목들을 hypotheses/ 폴더에 1-file-per-hypothesis로 따로 관리. raw#12 정합 cycle (birth → run → verdict → retract/expand) + cell metaphor (mitosis/apoptosis/growth — abstract analogy) + 탐색 method (E1-E12) + 검증 method (W1-W12) 2-lane logic-exhaustion enumeration. .roadmap.hypothesis는 인덱스 + cycle definition, 실제 H_X 가설들은 hypotheses/H_<id>_<slug>.md 별도 파일.
# Past evidence:
#   - raw#12 = pre-registered hypotheses, frozen specs, post-hoc tuning forbidden (anima/.guide line 6)
#   - state/ pre-register JSON inventory 30+ files (longitudinal_pre_register.json + axis96_*_pre_register.json + clm_eeg_p1/p2/p3_pre_register.json + an11_v2_finetune_translation_ceiling_prereg + mk_*_prereg + cmt_v2_*_pre_register 등)
#   - git log hypothesis cycle commits 30+ (F1-cycle4-T8p Wolfram sweep MIXED + ccc6cdb2 density hypothesis SUPPORTED + g8 4-hypothesis pre-register + r6 tokenizer drift partially supported + acceleration 367/304/47/40 hypothesis sequential expansions)
#   - mitosis.md / growth_engine.md / cell-related modules (ready/docs/modules/)
