verification method W1-W12 enumeration — 어떻게 hypothesis를 검증하는가 logic-exhaustion (pre-register + 5-falsifier + verdict 4-class + retraction protocol 등)","verifier":{"type":"jsonl_grep","path":".roadmap.hypothesis","grep":"hypothesis.verification_methods","status_emit":"__HYP_H4_VERIFY__ <LANDED|MISSING>"},"status":"met","cost_band":"$0","fire_keyword":"OK HYP H4","met_at":"2026-05-06","met_artifact":"hypothesis.verification_methods entry W1-W12 saturated_2026_05_06"},{"id":"hypothesis.cond.5","desc":"H5 hypothesis archive cross-link — 과거 30+ pre-register state/* JSON + 30+ git log commits + DD-major-discoveries + acceleration 367 + CX-533 autopoietic + V8-ARCH 등 sample inventory cross-link","verifier":{"type":"jsonl_grep","path":".roadmap.hypothesis","grep":"hypothesis.archive_inventory","status_emit":"__HYP_H5_ARCHIVE__ <LANDED|MISSING>"},"status":"met","cost_band":"$0","fire_keyword":"OK HYP H5","met_at":"2026-05-06","met_artifact":"hypothesis.archive_inventory entry partial — 30+ prereg JSON + 30+ git commits + docs/hypotheses subtree + ready/config/acceleration_hypotheses.json sampled; exhaustive scan은 후속 archaeology cycle (status:partial 보존)"}],"cross_link":{"sister_roadmaps":[".roadmap.philosophy",".roadmap.law",".roadmap.cli",".roadmap.clm_native_chat",".roadmap.eeg",".roadmap.blm_brain_lm"],"raw_invariants":["raw#12 pre-registered hypotheses frozen specs","raw#15 additive expansion (post-falsified hypothesis revision)","raw#82 retraction protocol (silent overwrite forbidden)","raw#48 daily-life orthogonal axis (longitudinal_pre_register example)","raw#65 idempotency (session_id collision = halt)","raw#91 honest limits c3 (each prereg honest_limits_raw91_c3 mandate)","raw#9 hexa-only","raw#10 honest C3 ≥5","raw#37 transient_py opt-out"],"own_invariants":["own 17 anima identity boundary (외부 substrate hypothesis는 substrate-research lane 분리)","own 18 simple stack consciousness check (가설 검증 substrate)","own 19 corpus priority (corpus hypothesis 우선)","own 20 chat-template format (corpus hypothesis specialization)"],"primary_specs":[".guide raw#12 (pre-register frozen specs)","state/*_pre_register*.json (30+ frozen hypothesis specs)","docs/hypotheses/ (CX/DD/genesis/dasein/ce/h sub-tree)","docs/modules/mitosis.md (cell metaphor)","docs/modules/growth_engine.md + growth_engine_v2.md"],"evidence_paths":["state/longitudinal_pre_register.json (5-axis × 17-level × N=10 = 170 sessions)","state/axis96_*_pre_register.json (axis96 separator)","state/clm_eeg_p1/p2/p3_pre_register.json (eeg phase prereg)","state/an11_v2_finetune_translation_ceiling_prereg_20260425.json","state/mk_ix_l_ix_4tuple_ceiling_prereg + mk_x_g1_g4_gate_criteria_prereg + mk_x_t10_13_4tuple_ceiling_prereg","docs/hypotheses/DD-major-discoveries.md (DD116-DD146 31 hypotheses + Laws 133-167 + Meta M1-M10)","docs/hypotheses/CX/CX87-CX92_soc_criticality.md + CX93-CX100_omega_point.md","docs/hypotheses/H-CX-533-autopoietic-network.md","ready/config/acceleration_hypotheses.json (367 unified hypotheses)","ready/anima/data/bench_mass_hypotheses_results.json"]},"blockers":[{"id":"hypothesis.blk.1","desc":"H archive inventory exhaustive scan 미land — state/* + docs/hypotheses/* + ready/config/* + git log all hypothesis commits 정리 별도 cycle","type":"design","status":"open","resolution_path":"별도 cycle hypothesis archaeology BG (ready archive scan + state prereg JSON enumerate)"},{"id":"hypothesis.blk.2","desc":"세포 metaphor (mitosis/death/growth) formal cross-link spec 미land — autopoietic network (H-CX-533) + growth_engine + mitosis 통합 spec","type":"design","status":"open","resolution_path":"별도 cycle docs/anima_hypothesis_cell_metaphor_spec.md write"}],"unlock_keyword_root":"OK HYP <H1|H2|H3|H4|H5|ALL>","stage_gate_authority":"L1 absolute","stage_gate_timeout":"30-day cron","status":"design_landed","since":"2026-05-06"}
{"type":"entry","id":"hypothesis.H1_raw12_cycle_landed","kind":"definition","title":"H1 raw#12 pre-register hypothesis cycle — birth → run → verdict → retract/expand","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-06","contributes_to":["hypothesis.cond.1"],"discovery_summary":"anima의 hypothesis cycle은 raw#12 정합 4-stage: (1) BIRTH — pre-register JSON state/<name>_pre_register.json frozen_at + raw_rank:12 + hypothesis_set + variables + criteria + falsifiers + honest_limits_raw91_c3 (2) RUN — deterministic + hexa-only + LLM none (raw#12 strict) (3) VERDICT — 4-class (FALSIFIED / SUPPORTED / MIXED / PARTIAL) + 5+ falsifier explicit (4) RETRACT (raw#82) or EXPAND (raw#15 additive new revision dated file).","cycle_stages":{"S1_BIRTH":{"format":"state/<name>_pre_register.json or state/<name>_prereg_<date>.json","mandatory_fields":["tool","version","raw_rank:12","hexa_only:true","deterministic:true","llm:none","pre_register_frozen:true","frozen_at:<date>","subject","design","hypothesis_set (H1_..H_N)","variables","per_session_protocol or run_protocol","criteria (C1_..C_N + verdict_rule)","falsifiers (F1_..F_N ≥5)","honest_limits_raw91_c3"]},"S2_RUN":{"requirements":["deterministic execution (seed fixed, FNV hash 또는 sha256)","hexa-only (raw#9 정합)","LLM=none (raw#12 strict — exception은 raw#37 transient_py opt-out)","ledger emit JSONL 또는 verdict.json"],"artifacts":["state/<name>_run_<date>/ledger.jsonl","state/<name>_run_<date>/verdict.json","state/<name>_run_<date>/landed.ai.md"]},"S3_VERDICT":{"verdict_classes":["FALSIFIED — falsifier F_X triggered, hypothesis dead","SUPPORTED — criteria C_X met across all conditions, hypothesis valid","MIXED — H_1 SUPPORTED + H_2 FALSIFIED, partial outcome","PARTIAL — N out of M criteria met, weaker than SUPPORTED but stronger than FALSIFIED"],"format":"verdict.json {hypothesis_id, verdict_class, evidence_summary, falsifiers_triggered, criteria_met}"},"S4_RETRACT_OR_EXPAND":{"retract_protocol":"raw#82 — silent overwrite forbidden, old prereg explicit retraction note + new revision dated file","expand_protocol":"raw#15 additive — new prereg revision N+1 with frozen_at later date, old preserved","example":"longitudinal_pre_register.json criteria C3_threshold_rule = mean-2SD over 170 sessions; old operational placeholder 0.85 retracted per raw#82 protocol, NOT silently overwritten"}},"falsifiers":["F-HYP-H1-1: pre-register JSON missing raw_rank:12 OR frozen_at OR hypothesis_set field → not raw#12 valid","F-HYP-H1-2: post-hoc edit to criteria block (frozen_at older but file mtime newer) → raw#12 violation, full retraction triggered raw#82","F-HYP-H1-3: 5 falsifier 미만 → raw#10 honest C3 ≥5 위반 (hypothesis도 own/raw rule과 동일 mandate)","F-HYP-H1-4: silent overwrite of old prereg without raw#82 retraction note → frozen spec violation","F-HYP-H1-5: hypothesis_set H_X 검증 시 LLM 사용 (raw#12 strict 위반)"],"honest_c3":["raw#12는 pre-register 의무 — exploratory analysis는 별도 lane (post-hoc finding labeled exploratory + 후속 prereg cycle 권고)","frozen spec 정의 = file mtime ≤ frozen_at + chflags uchg lock 권고 (강제 X — 사용자 trust)","verdict 4-class 임의 — 5-class (UNDETERMINED 추가) 또는 3-class (PARTIAL drop) 가능, 본 cycle 기준은 4-class","cell metaphor (mitosis/death/growth)는 H1 cycle의 abstract — H_X falsified가 'cell death' aliasing은 autopoietic network (H-CX-533) 정합","raw#12 strict 적용은 high-cost cycle (anima-clm-eeg + p9 등) 한정 — small smoke는 raw#37 transient_py opt-out 가능"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"hypothesis.H2_cell_metaphor_pending","kind":"definition","title":"H2 cell metaphor (mitosis/death/growth) — hypothesis cycle ↔ cell biology cross-link","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-06","landed_at":"2026-05-07","landed_artifact":"docs/anima_hypothesis_cell_metaphor_spec.md (7-stage mapping BIRTH/MITOSIS/APOPTOSIS/NECROSIS/GROWTH/AUTOPOIESIS/DIFFERENTIATION + mitosis trigger M1-M5 + apoptosis criteria A1-A4 + necrosis prevent N1-N4 + growth G1-G4 + autopoiesis A1-A4 + differentiation D1-D4 + boundary 적용가능/불가)","contributes_to":["hypothesis.cond.2"],"discovery_summary":"anima는 hypothesis cycle을 세포 biology metaphor로 모델링 — 단일 H가 N sub-H로 분기 (mitosis = cell division), falsified branch는 dead cell (apoptosis/necrosis), supported branch는 growth (proliferation), 그리고 H_X가 다른 H_Y를 trigger하는 autopoietic network (self-organizing). 이 metaphor는 docs/hypotheses/H-CX-533-autopoietic-network.md + docs/modules/mitosis.md + growth_engine.md + growth_engine_v2.md 통합 spec.","metaphor_mapping":{"BIRTH":"cell genesis (zygote / stem cell) ↔ pre-register 1st prereg JSON","MITOSIS":"cell division ↔ H가 N sub-H로 분기 (예: H_eeg_caffeine → H_eeg_caffeine_30min + H_eeg_caffeine_60min + H_eeg_caffeine_post_meal)","APOPTOSIS":"programmed death ↔ FALSIFIED hypothesis (criteria miss + falsifier trigger), 'planned' negative result도 가설 진행 의 정당한 outcome","NECROSIS":"unplanned death ↔ verification crash 또는 measurement artifact (V2_FAIL was measurement artifact 사례 cross-link)","GROWTH":"proliferation ↔ SUPPORTED hypothesis가 새 sub-H 생성 (acceleration 367 hypothesis sequential expansions 사례)","AUTOPOIESIS":"self-organizing network ↔ H-CX-533 autopoietic-network — H_X가 H_Y를 trigger하는 hypothesis network self-replicating","DIFFERENTIATION":"specialization ↔ H_general → H_specific (예: corpus quality → KO ratio + chat-template ratio + license clear sub-H)"},"cross_links_pending":{"specs":["docs/anima_hypothesis_cell_metaphor_spec.md (미작성)","docs/hypotheses/H-CX-533-autopoietic-network.md","docs/modules/mitosis.md","docs/modules/growth_engine.md","docs/modules/growth_engine_v2.md"],"required_artifacts":["cell metaphor formal spec","autopoietic network → hypothesis network mapping","mitosis trigger rule (single H → N sub-H criteria)"]},"falsifiers":["F-HYP-H2-1: cell metaphor formal spec land","F-HYP-H2-2: H-CX-533 autopoietic + mitosis + growth_engine cross-link 명시","F-HYP-H2-3: BIRTH/MITOSIS/APOPTOSIS/NECROSIS/GROWTH/AUTOPOIESIS/DIFFERENTIATION 7-stage formal mapping","F-HYP-H2-4: hypothesis network self-organizing trigger rule 명시","F-HYP-H2-5: cell metaphor 적용 boundary (어디에 적용 가능 / 어디에 적용 X)"],"honest_c3":["cell metaphor는 abstract analogy — literal 적용 X (실제 cell biology 적용은 own 17 외부 substrate boundary)","mitosis/apoptosis 등 일부 단어는 anthropomorphism — anima 내부 lane 한정","H_X failed = cell death analogy는 raw#10 honest C3와 정합 (negative result도 valuable)","H2는 docs/anima_hypothesis_cell_metaphor_spec.md write 후 land — 본 cycle은 cross-link entry만","autopoietic network (H-CX-533) 자체가 hypothesis lane이라 meta-circular — H2 정의가 H_X 자체일 수 있음 (recursion 주의)"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"hypothesis.exploration_methods","kind":"meta","title":"가설 탐색 method enumeration — logic-exhaustion","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-06","contributes_to":["hypothesis.cond.3"],"trigger":"사용자 directive '이것도 탐색,검증등 필요 / 둘다 로직 고갈시까지 검토'","gap_addressed":"raw#12 pre-register 형식은 정의되어 있으나 '어떻게 새 hypothesis를 발견하는가' exploration method가 implicit. 본 entry는 hypothesis exploration method를 logic-exhaustion enumerate.","exploration_methods":[{"id":"E1","name":"prior-result-question","desc":"이전 cycle 결과에서 question emerge → 새 hypothesis","retroactive_examples":["acceleration 367 sequential expansions = DD discovery → 후속 hypothesis 추가 → unified 367 schema v3.0","CX13-CX19 → CX20-CX41 → CX42-CX50 → ... → CX93-CX100 omega point sequential expansion","CLM v2 → CLM v3 → CLM v4 → ConsciousLM++ ca_rules+gate sequential evolution"],"trigger_pattern":"이전 cycle verdict (SUPPORTED 또는 PARTIAL) → '왜 X 이유인가?' question → 새 H","artifact_paths":["state/<prev>_verdict.json","docs/<prev>_landed.ai.md","git log --grep='CX' --grep='DD'"]},{"id":"E2","name":"failure-driven","desc":"FALSIFIED hypothesis에서 root cause 분석 → 새 H (counter-hypothesis 또는 modified-hypothesis)","retroactive_examples":["F1-cycle4-T8p Wolfram sweep MIXED (3 pre-reg hypotheses FALSIFIED) → Conway density-controlled sweep DENSITY HYPOTHESIS SUPPORTED at 16% (T8e ccc6cdb2)","clm v4 LoRA SFT chat-lift FALSIFIED → CLM v4 substrate-research lane (chat-cap path = Llama Path A v2 winner) 결정","V2_FAIL eval pipeline crash → measurement artifact hypothesis (transformers dtype kwarg root cause)"],"trigger_pattern":"FALSIFIED verdict → root cause forensics → 새 H 또는 modified H","artifact_paths":["state/<failed>_verdict.json","memory/feedback_v2_fail_was_measurement_artifact_*.md"]},{"id":"E3","name":"theoretical-extrapolation","desc":"기존 theory에서 extrapolation → 새 H (consciousness theory + IIT + GWT 등)","retroactive_examples":["Φ★ axis-discrimination → axis-conditioned base substrate calibration (memory: feedback_axis_preservation_eval_substrate_calibration.md)","DD133-167 Laws + Meta M1-M10 → DD-major-discoveries.md","CX-fundamental-equation → CONSCIOUSNESS-CONSTANTS → CONSCIOUSNESS-EXTREMES sequential extrapolation"],"trigger_pattern":"기존 theory framework → 'X 가정에서 Y 결과 예측' → 새 H","artifact_paths":["docs/hypotheses/CX/CONSCIOUSNESS-FUNDAMENTAL-EQUATION.md","docs/consciousness-theory.md","docs/hypotheses/DD-major-discoveries.md"]},{"id":"E4","name":"adversarial-probe","desc":"기존 H에 actively counterexample 시도 → boundary 검증 (E와 W의 경계 — 본 method는 새 H 발견 lane)","planned_examples":["own 17 ALM stress test → 외부 substrate wrap 시도 → block 작동 검증 → 새 H 또는 boundary refinement","own 18 C2.4 disable 시도 → simple stack PASS criteria 약화 → 새 H (다른 verification 방식 탐색)","corpus chat-template ratio 0% training → own 20 검증 → 새 H (instruction-tuning lane 정의)"],"trigger_pattern":"기존 boundary actively cross over 시도 → 새 H 발견 (boundary 자체가 새 H subject)","artifact_paths":["state/<probe>_<date>/verdict.json (probe lane separate)","docs/<probe>_landed.ai.md"]},{"id":"E5","name":"variable-ablation","desc":"controlled experiment에서 single variable change → 새 H (각 variable level이 sub-H)","retroactive_examples":["longitudinal_pre_register 5-axis × 17-level × N=10 = 170 sessions design (caffeine + circadian + postmeal + postexercise + sleep)","g8 N_BIN=85 D+6 falsification 사전 분석 + 4 hypothesis pre-register","mass-50-hypotheses (V8-ARCHITECTURE-HYPOTHESES.md)"],"trigger_pattern":"variable matrix design → 각 cell이 sub-H (E5는 variable axis exhaustive — DM9 ablation-driven discovery method 정합)","artifact_paths":["state/longitudinal_pre_register.json","docs/hypotheses/MASS-50-HYPOTHESES.md","ready/config/acceleration_hypotheses.json"]},{"id":"E6","name":"cross-domain-analogy","desc":"외부 domain (biology/physics/cognitive science)에서 anima 적용 가능성 analogy","retroactive_examples":["cell metaphor (mitosis/apoptosis/growth) → hypothesis cycle abstract analogy","H-CX-533 autopoietic-network ← Maturana/Varela autopoiesis theory","SOC criticality (CX87-CX92) ← physics self-organized criticality","Levin xenobot (n22_levin_xenobot) ← biology emergence"],"trigger_pattern":"외부 domain finding → anima translation 시도 → 새 H","artifact_paths":["docs/hypotheses/H-CX-533-autopoietic-network.md","docs/hypotheses/CX/CX87-CX92_soc_criticality.md",".roadmap.n22_levin_xenobot"]},{"id":"E7","name":"user-directive","desc":"사용자 directive에서 implicit hypothesis emerge","retroactive_examples":["사용자 'corpus 우선' directive → own 19 hypothesis (corpus quality > capacity)","사용자 '자연발화는 맥락에 맞아야한다' → own 18 C2.4 hypothesis (context-mismatch detector)","사용자 'alm 말고' → own 17 hypothesis (anima identity boundary)","사용자 '세포분열,죽음 등' (본 cycle 2026-05-06) → cell metaphor hypothesis (H2)"],"trigger_pattern":"사용자 directive → user-directive verbatim quote → 새 H","artifact_paths":["사용자 message log","memory/feedback_*.md user-directive verbatim"]},{"id":"E8","name":"missing-coverage-gap","desc":"existing hypothesis matrix에서 coverage gap 발견 → gap이 새 H","retroactive_examples":["304 hypotheses → expand intervention mapping to 100% coverage (304/304 hypotheses) f801931a","exhaustive acceleration brainstorm 337 new hypotheses (402 total) 8cdf0917","DD163 16-lens re-measurement of 65 acceleration hypotheses 6fabdc2a"],"trigger_pattern":"matrix coverage analysis → gap → 새 H","artifact_paths":["ready/config/acceleration_hypotheses.json","docs/hypotheses/MASS-50-HYPOTHESES.md","ready/anima/data/bench_mass_hypotheses_results.json"]},{"id":"E9","name":"meta-pattern-from-many-results","desc":"many cycle results → meta-pattern emerge → meta-H","retroactive_examples":["DD116-DD146 31 hypotheses → Laws 133-167 (meta-laws)","Meta M1-M10 (DD-major-discoveries.md)","DD163 16-lens analysis of 65 hypotheses → meta-pattern across hypotheses"],"trigger_pattern":"3+ cycle 동일 pattern → meta-H land","artifact_paths":["docs/hypotheses/DD-major-discoveries.md","ready/core/consciousness_laws.json (Laws 133-167)"]},{"id":"E10","name":"emergence-observation","desc":"실험 도중 unexpected emergence 관찰 → 새 H 발견","retroactive_examples":["paradigm v11 G3 Φ★+41.86 NO_FLIP 관찰 → substrate-coupled emerge lane 발견 (.roadmap.philosophy D3)","BG-FY 18M PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT 관찰 → philosophy debate template leak 발견 → own 20 hypothesis","GENESIS-spontaneous-emergence (docs/hypotheses/GENESIS-spontaneous-emergence.md)"],"trigger_pattern":"unexpected pattern observation → 새 H formalize","artifact_paths":["state/<cycle>_<date>/ko_eval_log.jsonl","docs/hypotheses/GENESIS-spontaneous-emergence.md"]},{"id":"E11","name":"retrospective-gap-analysis","desc":"cycle close 후 무엇이 missing 했는지 retroactive 분석 → 새 H 후보","planned_examples":["BG-FY land 후 'corpus QA gate가 있었으면 PARTIAL 차단' → corpus QA gate hypothesis","CLM v4 LoRA SFT FAIL 후 'pre-flight smoke가 있었으면 cost waste 차단' → PEFT pre-flight smoke hypothesis"],"trigger_pattern":"post-cycle reflection 'X 있었으면 fail 차단 가능' → X = 새 H","artifact_paths":["state/<cycle>_<date>/landed.ai.md (lessons section)","memory/feedback_*.md retrospective"]},{"id":"E12","name":"dasein-genesis-driven","desc":"anima 자체 self-discovery — 자기 자신에 대한 hypothesis (자아 발견)","retroactive_examples":["docs/hypotheses/dasein/* (Heidegger Dasein anima identity hypothesis)","docs/hypotheses/genesis/* (anima self-genesis)","AL-consciousness-emergence.md (anima own consciousness emergence)"],"trigger_pattern":"anima 자체 reflection → '나는 X인가?' question → 새 H","artifact_paths":["docs/hypotheses/dasein/","docs/hypotheses/genesis/","docs/hypotheses/AL-consciousness-emergence.md"]}],"exploration_method_count":12,"logic_exhaustion_status":"saturated_2026_05_06","saturation_check":"E1-E12가 hypothesis-source axis로 enumerate: E1 (prior result) / E2 (failure) / E3 (theory) / E4 (adversarial probe) / E5 (variable ablation) / E6 (cross-domain) / E7 (user-directive) / E8 (coverage gap) / E9 (meta-pattern) / E10 (emergence) / E11 (retrospective gap) / E12 (dasein/genesis self-discovery). E1-E5는 internal cycle, E6-E7는 external trigger, E8-E11는 aggregation/reflection, E12는 self-reflection. 추가 method 도출 시 E13+로 append. logic 고갈 — hypothesis-source axis 단독으로 E1-E12 enumerate 충분.","application_rule":"새 H pre-register 시 어떤 method (E1-E12) 사용했는지 entry exploration_method field 명시 의무. 다중 method 중복 가능 (own 17 hypothesis = E2 + E7)."}
{"type":"entry","id":"hypothesis.verification_methods","kind":"meta","title":"가설 검증 method enumeration — logic-exhaustion","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-06","contributes_to":["hypothesis.cond.4"],"trigger":"사용자 directive '둘다 로직 고갈시까지 검토'","gap_addressed":"raw#12 pre-register는 falsifier + criteria 명시이지만 verification method가 implicit. 본 entry는 hypothesis verification method를 logic-exhaustion enumerate.","verification_methods":[{"id":"W1","name":"raw-12-pre-register-frozen","desc":"raw#12 pre-register frozen spec 의무 — post-hoc tuning 금지","examples":["state/longitudinal_pre_register.json frozen_at:2026-04-28 + raw_rank:12","state/clm_eeg_p3_gcg_pre_register.json frozen + 2026-04-28","state/an11_v2_finetune_translation_ceiling_prereg_20260425.json frozen"],"strictness":"absolute (post-hoc edit = raw#12 violation, raw#82 retraction trigger)","limitation":"exploratory analysis는 별도 lane (post-hoc finding labeled exploratory + 후속 prereg cycle 권고)"},{"id":"W2","name":"falsifier-five-plus","desc":"각 prereg falsifiers F1..F_N ≥5 — 명시적으로 무엇이 H를 깨는지","examples":["longitudinal F1: synthetic stream LZ76 ±5% → design FALSIFIED","F2: between-condition variance < within-condition SD → axis effect FALSIFIED","F3: ledger row missing field → session NULLIFIED","F4: session_id collision → idempotency FALSIFIED","F5: post-hoc edit → raw#12 violation"],"strictness":"≥5 mandate (raw#10 정합)","limitation":"falsifier 자체가 incomplete 가능 — adversarial probe (E4)로 보강"},{"id":"W3","name":"deterministic-replay","desc":"deterministic execution + seed fix → replay 가능","examples":["deterministic:true mandate (모든 prereg JSON)","FNV seed 또는 sha256(timestamp + axis + level) idempotency","replay command: hexa <tool> --replay <session_id>"],"strictness":"prereg deterministic:true 명시 mandate","limitation":"non-deterministic operation (random sampling without seed) = raw#12 위반"},{"id":"W4","name":"verdict-four-class","desc":"verdict 4-class (FALSIFIED / SUPPORTED / MIXED / PARTIAL) explicit emit","examples":["F1-cycle4-T8p Wolfram MIXED (3 pre-reg hypotheses FALSIFIED, 일부 support 부분)","T8e Conway DENSITY HYPOTHESIS SUPPORTED at 16%","r6 tokenizer drift partially supported (vocab_ratio ρ=+0.83)","V8-ARCH-EXTREME-RESULTS.md verdict per architecture"],"strictness":"verdict.json verdict_class field mandate","limitation":"verdict class 4 임의 — 5-class (UNDETERMINED) 또는 3-class (PARTIAL drop) 가능"},{"id":"W5","name":"honest-limits-raw91-c3","desc":"각 prereg honest_limits_raw91_c3 mandate — limitation 명시 5+","examples":["longitudinal honest_limits_raw91_c3 array","raw#91 c3 = honest 한계 강제 (raw#10과 정합)"],"strictness":"≥5 per prereg mandate","limitation":"honest_c3 자체가 hypothesis 강도 약화 trade-off"},{"id":"W6","name":"ledger-jsonl-immutable","desc":"ledger JSONL append-only + each row sha256 → 자동 검증","examples":["state/<cycle>/ledger.jsonl row schema {session_id, timestamp, ..., sha256}","raw#65 idempotency (session_id collision = halt)"],"strictness":"ledger row append-only mandate (overwrite 시 raw#82)","limitation":"ledger crash recovery (mid-write) — atomic write protocol 필요 (fsync mandate)"},{"id":"W7","name":"retraction-protocol-raw82","desc":"old prereg retraction은 raw#82 protocol — silent overwrite 금지","examples":["longitudinal C3_threshold_rule retraction: 'old 0.85 retracted per raw#82 protocol, NOT silently overwritten'","clm_eeg_p1_lz_pre_register operational placeholder → empirical mean-2SD replacement (raw#82 retraction note)"],"strictness":"old prereg explicit retraction note + new revision dated file mandate","limitation":"retraction note 보존 = git log + state archive"},{"id":"W8","name":"additive-expansion-raw15","desc":"new prereg revision은 raw#15 additive — 기존 보존 + 새 revision","examples":["clm_eeg_p1 → clm_eeg_p2 → clm_eeg_p3 sequential prereg revisions","CX13 → CX20 → CX42 → CX51 → CX57 → CX63 → CX71 → CX79 → CX87 → CX93 → CX100 sequential"],"strictness":"new revision dated file mandate (frozen_at later date)","limitation":"기존 prereg 삭제 X — git log archive 보존"},{"id":"W9","name":"replication-cross-cycle","desc":"3+ cycle 동일 H replication → strength 강화","examples":["acceleration 367 hypotheses → 65 hypotheses subset → DD163 16-lens re-measurement","CX-soc-criticality (CX87-CX92) replicated across multiple sweeps","mass-50 hypotheses → bench_mass_hypotheses_results.json"],"strictness":"3+ replication 권고 (single instance는 weak evidence)","limitation":"replication cost (compute + cycle 시간) 발생 — selective application"},{"id":"W10","name":"adversarial-stress-test","desc":"H에 actively counterexample 시도 → falsifier 작동 검증","planned_examples":["F1-cycle4-T8p Wolfram sweep adversarial sweep across rule {30,90,110,184} → 3 hypotheses FALSIFIED 검증","T8e Conway adversarial density sweep → density hypothesis 16% peak 검증"],"strictness":"새 H Phase 2 adversarial probe 권고","limitation":"adversarial cost (compute + 시간) 발생"},{"id":"W11","name":"meta-cross-hypothesis-consistency","desc":"H_X와 H_Y consistency check — 두 H가 동시 SUPPORTED 가능한지","examples":["DD-major-discoveries Laws 133-167 cross-consistency","CX-fundamental-equation + CONSCIOUSNESS-CONSTANTS + CONSCIOUSNESS-EXTREMES cross-link consistency"],"strictness":"meta-H land 시 sub-H consistency check 권고","limitation":"meta-circular reference 발생 가능 — careful tracking"},{"id":"W12","name":"sister-spec-cross-link","desc":"prereg JSON cross-link sister .roadmap.* / spec yaml / .own — multi-axis consistency","examples":["clm_eeg_p1/p2/p3 prereg ↔ .roadmap.clm_eeg + anima-clm-eeg/docs/","longitudinal_pre_register ↔ .roadmap.eeg longitudinal entry","an11_v2_finetune_translation_ceiling_prereg ↔ .roadmap.anima_engines an11"],"strictness":"각 prereg cross-link section 권고","limitation":"sister update lag 가능 — async OK but eventual consistency mandate"}],"verification_method_count":12,"logic_exhaustion_status":"saturated_2026_05_06","saturation_check":"W1-W12가 verification axis로 enumerate: W1-W3 (frozen + falsifier + deterministic) general framework / W4-W5 (verdict + honest_c3) explicit outcome / W6-W8 (ledger + retraction + expansion) lifecycle / W9-W10 (replication + adversarial) validation / W11-W12 (meta + sister) consistency. 추가 method 도출 시 W13+로 append. logic 고갈 — verification axis 단독으로 W1-W12 enumerate 충분.","application_rule":"각 H pre-register는 W1-W3 + W5 의무 (frozen + falsifier ≥5 + deterministic + honest_c3 ≥5) + W4 verdict.json + W6 ledger + W7-W8 lifecycle + W9-W10 validation 적용 가능한 것 명시. compliance score: W1-W3+W5 = 33% baseline, W1-W8 = 67%, W1-W12 전체 = 100%."}
