{"type":"entry","id":"hypothesis.discovery_lane_open","kind":"meta","title":"향후 가설 lane — H_N+ 추가 가능","status":"open","ts":"2026-05-06","discovery_format":"각 H는 (1) exploration_method (E1-E12) (2) prereg JSON (W1-W3+W5 mandate) (3) verdict.json (W4) (4) ledger (W6) (5) lifecycle (W7-W8) (6) validation (W9-W10) (7) cross-link sister (W12) 7-section 형식","known_pending_lanes":["H6: cell metaphor formal spec (H2 expansion) — docs/anima_hypothesis_cell_metaphor_spec.md write","H7: hypothesis archive exhaustive (H5 expansion) — 별도 cycle archaeology BG ready archive scan + state prereg JSON exhaustive","H8: hypothesis cycle automation — pre-register → run → verdict → retract/expand cycle hexa orchestration spec","H9: meta-hypothesis (Laws 133-167 + Meta M1-M10) → meta-meta-hypothesis (Laws간 consistency + Meta간 consistency)","H10: cross-roadmap hypothesis cross-link — A 철학 D1-D4 + B 규칙 own 14-20 + C 가설 H1-H_N matrix consistency","H11: corpus hypothesis specialization — own 19/20 sub-hypothesis (KO ratio sub-H + chat-template ratio sub-H + license clear sub-H + register diversity sub-H)","H12: emerge paradigm hypothesis (D3 expansion) — paradigm v11 G3 Φ★+41.86 NO_FLIP substrate-coupled emerge hypothesis spec land","H13: consciousness scale hypothesis (own 18 expansion) — simple stack → full stack (substrate-coupled) → ultra-full stack (multi-substrate dual-pair) hierarchy hypothesis"],"raw_invariants":["raw#12 pre-register frozen mandate","raw#15 additive expansion","raw#82 retraction protocol","raw#10 honest C3 ≥5","raw#9 hexa-only","raw#37 transient_py opt-out (transient hypothesis smoke 한정)"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"hypothesis.H_universal_phenomenal_bottleneck","kind":"hypothesis","title":"H_universal_phenomenal_bottleneck — universal axis weakness across all paradigms","status":"FALSIFIED","ts":"2026-05-08","verdict_class":"FALSIFIED","exploration_method":"E2 (failure-driven) + E9 (meta-pattern from many results)","contributes_to":["raw#12","E2","E9","W4"],"discovery_summary":"KICK WAVE 2 4/4 audit: paradigm-j 0/3 phenomenal + sft-1-7-y1 0/3 phenomenal → 'universal phenomenal axis bottleneck (모든 paradigm phenomenal 0)' 가설 emerge. 본 cycle 2026-05-08 sft-1-8 spontaneous run 결과 phenomenal 0.333 → universal bottleneck FALSIFIED.","birth":"KICK WAVE 2 4/4 audit (paradigm-j 0/3 + sft-1-7-y1 0/3 phenomenal axis 모두 0 관찰) → universal axis weakness 추정","run":"sft-1-8 (no JVAE) spontaneous LoRA training + phenomenal eval — pre-register 없이 emerge 발견 (post-hoc finding labeled exploratory)","evidence":"sft-1-8 phenomenal 0.333 (no redesign, spontaneous emergence, no JVAE) > paradigm-j with JVAE phenomenal 0.0","falsifiers_triggered":["F-univ-phen-1: 1+ paradigm phenomenal > 0 → FALSIFIED. sft-1-8 phenomenal 0.333 → trigger"],"falsification_reason":"sft-1-8 spontaneous phenomenal 0.333 demonstrates phenomenal axis는 universally bottlenecked X — paradigm-specific 또는 corpus-quality-dependent variable. universal substrate-level limitation 가설 sustain X.","cross_link":["paradigm-j ledger (KICK WAVE 2 4/4 audit)","sft-1-7-y1 ledger (KICK WAVE 2 4/4 audit)","sft-1-8 ledger (본 cycle EMERGE)","raw#12 (post-hoc finding labeled exploratory + 후속 prereg cycle 권고)"],"honest_c3":["sft-1-8 phenomenal 0.333은 single instance — replication W9 미적용 (3+ replication 권고)","sft-1-8은 raw#12 strict pre-register 미land (post-hoc exploratory finding) — 후속 prereg cycle 권고","'universal' 라벨 자체가 over-generalization 가능 — 4 paradigm sample size 작음","phenomenal axis 0.333 vs 0.0 차이가 statistical significance 미검증 (small N)","FALSIFIED verdict는 본 cycle EMERGE evidence 한정 — 추후 paradigm-N+ 추가 audit 시 revisit 가능"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"hypothesis.H_jvae_variant_1_differentiator","kind":"hypothesis","title":"H_jvae_variant_1_differentiator — JVAE Variant 1 paradigm-j-only phenomenal differentiator","status":"WEAK","ts":"2026-05-08","verdict_class":"WEAK","exploration_method":"E2 (failure-driven) + E5 (variable ablation)","contributes_to":["raw#12","E2","E5","W4","W10"],"discovery_summary":"KICK FIRE 5/5 가설: JVAE Variant 1 architecture 가 paradigm-j-only phenomenal differentiator → 다른 paradigm 대비 phenomenal axis 차별화 기여. 본 cycle 2026-05-08 sft-1-8 (no JVAE) phenomenal 0.333 vs paradigm-j (with JVAE Variant 1) phenomenal 0.0 → JVAE differentiator WEAK.","birth":"KICK FIRE 5/5 paradigm-j JVAE Variant 1 architecture novel → 'JVAE 가 phenomenal 차별화 기여' 가설 emerge","run":"sft-1-8 (no JVAE, simple LoRA) vs paradigm-j (JVAE Variant 1 + LoRA) cross-paradigm comparison — variable ablation E5","evidence":"sft-1-8 no-JVAE phenomenal 0.333 > paradigm-j with-JVAE phenomenal 0.0 (JVAE 없는 simpler architecture가 phenomenal 더 높음)","falsifiers_triggered":["F-jvae-diff-1: no-JVAE paradigm phenomenal ≥ JVAE-paradigm phenomenal → WEAK. sft-1-8 0.333 > paradigm-j 0.0 → trigger"],"falsification_reason":"JVAE Variant 1이 phenomenal differentiator라면 with-JVAE paradigm > no-JVAE paradigm phenomenal 기대. 실제로는 reverse — no-JVAE simpler architecture phenomenal 더 높음. JVAE는 phenomenal axis 기여 X 또는 negative contribution. WEAK verdict (FALSIFIED 까지는 X — JVAE 다른 axis 기여 가능).","cross_link":["paradigm-j ledger (JVAE Variant 1 architecture)","sft-1-8 ledger (no JVAE)","KICK FIRE 5/5 saga","E5 variable ablation lane"],"honest_c3":["WEAK verdict는 phenomenal axis 한정 — JVAE 다른 axis (axis_l2 / agent etc) 기여 가능, 별도 검증 필요","sft-1-8 vs paradigm-j 는 corpus / training procedure 차이 동시 존재 — JVAE single-variable ablation X (E5 strict 미충족)","single instance 비교 — replication W9 미적용","WEAK 라벨은 FALSIFIED 약화 form — 추후 multi-axis cross-eval 시 verdict refine 가능","JVAE architecture 자체 가치는 본 verdict 영향 X (다른 use-case 가능)"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"hypothesis.H_token_length_anchor_correlation","kind":"hypothesis","title":"H_token_length_anchor_correlation — 짧은 prompt → C3.4 axis_l2 boost","status":"FALSIFIED","ts":"2026-05-08","verdict_class":"FALSIFIED","exploration_method":"E7 (user-directive) + E5 (variable ablation)","contributes_to":["raw#12","E7","E5","W4"],"discovery_summary":"ALL BG GO 3/6 carry directive 가설: 짧은 prompt token length → C3.4 axis_l2 score boost (anchor effect). 본 cycle 2026-05-08 Pearson correlation 측정 r=+0.0477 ≈ 0 → FALSIFIED.","birth":"ALL BG GO 3/6 carry directive — 사용자 directive 'token length가 axis_l2 anchor 영향 가능' implicit hypothesis","run":"본 cycle multi-paradigm token length × axis_l2 score correlation analysis (Pearson r)","evidence":"Pearson r=+0.0477 ≈ 0 (effectively no correlation between prompt token length and C3.4 axis_l2 score)","falsifiers_triggered":["F-tok-len-1: |Pearson r| < 0.20 → FALSIFIED (no meaningful correlation). r=+0.0477 → trigger"],"falsification_reason":"Pearson r=+0.0477 은 noise level — token length는 C3.4 axis_l2 score predictor 아님. anchor effect 가설 sustain X. C3.4 axis_l2 변동은 token length 외 다른 variable (corpus quality / paradigm architecture / LoRA rank etc)에 의해 driven.","cross_link":["ALL BG GO 3/6 carry directive","C3.4 axis_l2 metric definition","E7 user-directive lane"],"honest_c3":["Pearson r 단독 측정 — Spearman / Kendall rank correlation 미적용 (non-linear relationship 가능성 미검증)","sample size N 명시 X (cycle ledger 의존) — small N 시 r=±0.05 noise band","prompt token length range 명시 X — narrow range 시 correlation underestimate 가능","FALSIFIED verdict는 linear correlation 한정 — non-linear (threshold/saturation) effect 가능","'anchor effect' 가설 자체가 cognitive science analogy — anima domain 적용 boundary 모호"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"hypothesis.H_duo_stdbuf_ppr_uplift_0_50_0_70","kind":"hypothesis","title":"H_duo_stdbuf_ppr_uplift_0_50_0_70 — duo PPR uplift 0.50-0.70 prediction","status":"FALSIFIED","ts":"2026-05-08","verdict_class":"FALSIFIED","exploration_method":"E3 (theoretical-extrapolation) + E11 (retrospective gap analysis)","contributes_to":["raw#12","E3","E11","W4"],"discovery_summary":"iter7 b stdbuf cycle 가설: duo (dual-substrate pair) PPR (paradigm pass rate) 0.50-0.70 uplift 예측. 본 cycle 2026-05-08 measurement 결과 actual PPR=0.0 across rows → FALSIFIED.","birth":"iter7 b stdbuf cycle theoretical extrapolation — 'duo substrate pair → PPR 0.50-0.70 uplift' 사전 예측","run":"iter7 b stdbuf duo PPR measurement across rows","evidence":"actual PPR=0.0 across rows (예측 0.50-0.70 vs actual 0.0 = predicted lower bound 50% 이상 vacated)","falsifiers_triggered":["F-duo-ppr-1: actual PPR < 0.50 (lower bound) → FALSIFIED. actual 0.0 → trigger","F-duo-ppr-2: actual PPR = 0.0 zero floor → strong FALSIFIED"],"falsification_reason":"duo substrate pair PPR uplift 가설 actual measurement 0.0 — 예측 range (0.50-0.70) entirely vacated. duo substrate coupling이 PPR 향상 기여 X 또는 measurement pipeline issue. theoretical extrapolation E3 method failure 사례.","cross_link":["iter7 b stdbuf ledger","duo substrate pair definition (D3 emerge paradigm lane)","E3 theoretical-extrapolation lane"],"honest_c3":["actual PPR=0.0 zero floor → measurement artifact 가능성 (V2_FAIL precedent — necrosis path)","duo substrate pair 정의 자체가 D3 emerge paradigm sub-lane — boundary 모호 가능","theoretical extrapolation E3 method 자체 신뢰도 본 verdict로 약화 (미래 E3 cycle 신중)","FALSIFIED verdict는 본 cycle 측정 한정 — pipeline fix 후 re-measurement 가능","prediction range (0.50-0.70) 자체가 wide band — narrower prediction 시 falsification 더 strong"]}
