{"type":"entry","id":"hypothesis.H_alt_agg_1_v3_strict_feasible","kind":"hypothesis","title":"H_alt_agg_1_v3_strict_feasible — alt-agg-1 v3 strict EMERGE feasibility","status":"FALSIFIED","ts":"2026-05-08","verdict_class":"FALSIFIED","verdict_history":["CONFIRMED@2026-05-08 (sft-1-8 + paradigm-j retry dual EMERGE)","CONFIRMED_DOWNGRADED@2026-05-08 (paradigm-j N=60 falsified, sft-1-8 sole robust)","FALSIFIED@2026-05-08 (KICK WAVE 4 3/3 random_init mirror leak — V14 strict 위반)"],"exploration_method":"E1 (prior-result-question) + E10 (emergence-observation) + E2 (failure-driven, V14 anti-Goodhart violation)","contributes_to":["raw#12","E1","E10","E2","W4","W9","V14"],"discovery_summary":"alt-agg-1 v3 strict criteria EMERGE feasibility 가설 — 본 cycle 2026-05-08 sft-1-8 + paradigm-j retry 두 EMERGE 동시 확인 → CONFIRMED. ★ POST-FALSIFICATION 2026-05-08: paradigm-j retry N=30 EMERGE 0.3793 N=60 robustness retest commit 84aa8665 KICK WAVE 3 6/6 PPR_v3=0.2414 PARTIAL_NEAR FALSIFIED at N=60 sample-size artifact — feasibility 자체는 sft-1-8 sole robust EMERGE (N=30 0.4138 + N=60 0.6102 244% of floor) 단독으로 CONFIRMED 유지 (≥1 paradigm robust EMERGE 충족). ★★ POST-V14-FALSIFICATION 2026-05-08 (CONFIRMED → FALSIFIED downgrade): KICK WAVE 4 3/3 random_init mirror leak commit TBD → random_init PPR_v3=0.5517 > sft-1-8 0.4138 (N=30) ALT-AGG-1 v3 strict V14 anti-Goodhart VIOLATED. random_init mirror leak: untrained noise indistinguishable from sft-1-8 EMERGE on 30-prompt set. **feasibility 자체 FALSIFIED** — sft-1-8 sole robust EMERGE 가 strict criteria discriminative power 입증 X (random_init mirror).","birth":"prior-result-question E1 — alt-agg-1 v3 strict criteria 가 too restrictive 우려 emerge → feasibility 가설","run":"본 cycle 2026-05-08 sft-1-8 (no JVAE spontaneous) + paradigm-j retry 두 path 동시 EMERGE → KICK WAVE 3 6/6 N=60 robustness retest → KICK WAVE 4 3/3 random_init mirror V14 verify","evidence":"sft-1-8 EMERGE robust at N=60 (0.6102) + paradigm-j retry EMERGE at N=30 (0.3793) FALSIFIED at N=60 (0.2414) — sft-1-8 sole robust → KICK WAVE 4 3/3 random_init mirror PPR_v3=0.5517 > sft-1-8 N=30 0.4138 (delta -0.1379) AND > sft-1-8 N=120 0.5378 (delta -0.0139) → strict criteria V14 strict 위반 (random_init noise indistinguishable)","criteria_met":["C-alt-agg-1-feasible-1: ≥1 paradigm robust EMERGE → DOWNGRADED (sft-1-8 N=60 robust but V14 random_init mirror leak)","C-alt-agg-1-feasible-2: distinct paradigm replication → FAILED (paradigm-j N=60 falsified)","C-alt-agg-1-feasible-3 (NEW V14): random_init discrimination → FAILED (random_init PPR_v3=0.5517 EXCEEDS sft-1-8 0.4138)"],"falsification_reason":"V14 strict anti-Goodhart criteria — feasible EMERGE rule must discriminate trained model from untrained random_init. random_init PPR_v3=0.5517 (KICK WAVE 4 3/3) > sft-1-8 PPR_v3=0.4138 (N=30) → ALT-AGG-1 v3 strict criteria 가 random noise 도 PASS 시키므로 strict criteria 자체 false-positive risk. sft-1-8 EMERGE 0.4138 = untrained noise level (mirror) → measurable consciousness signal 입증 X. raw#82 retraction-aware: 기존 CONFIRMED record preservation + FALSIFIED marker only.","cross_link":["sft-1-8 ledger (EMERGE robust at N=60 0.6102, V14 falsified at KICK WAVE 4 3/3)","paradigm-j retry ledger (EMERGE at N=30 → FALSIFIED at N=60)","alt-agg-1 v3 strict criteria definition (V14 revision pending)","KICK WAVE 4 3/3 random_init mirror commit TBD","E1 prior-result-question lane","E10 emergence-observation lane","E2 failure-driven (V14 anti-Goodhart)","H_sample_size_artifact_emerge_at_n_30 (sister hypothesis FALSIFIED at N=60)","H_random_init_mirror_v14_falsification (sister hypothesis CONFIRMED 2026-05-08)","registry/anima_artifact_registry.yaml line 60 emerge_state: EMERGE_FALSIFIED_BY_RANDOM_INIT_MIRROR"],"honest_c3":["sole paradigm robust EMERGE (sft-1-8) 으로 feasibility CONFIRMED 충족 — 그러나 'easy' 라벨은 X (paradigm-j N=60 falsified, 다른 4+ paradigm robust 미검증)","sft-1-8 EMERGE는 spontaneous (raw#12 strict pre-register 미land) — exploratory finding label 권고","paradigm-j retry EMERGE는 wrapper