{"type":"entry","id":"hypothesis.H_sample_size_artifact_emerge_at_n_30","kind":"hypothesis","title":"H_sample_size_artifact_emerge_at_n_30 — paradigm-j retry N=30 EMERGE 가 sample-size artifact 인지","status":"FALSIFIED","ts":"2026-05-08","verdict_class":"FALSIFIED","exploration_method":"E2 (failure-driven) + E5 (variable ablation, sample size N axis) + E10 (emergence-observation)","contributes_to":["raw#12","raw#82","E2","E5","E10","W4","W9"],"discovery_summary":"paradigm-j retry N=30 PPR_v3=0.3793 EMERGE (commit 58fec5ed KICK WAVE 2 1/4) 가 robust signal 인지, 아니면 sample-size artifact false positive 인지 가설 — 본 cycle 2026-05-08 N=60 robustness retest (commit 84aa8665 KICK WAVE 3 6/6) PPR_v3=0.2414 < 0.25 floor → sample-size artifact CONFIRMED, 본 H_sample_size_artifact 가설 (N=30 EMERGE 가 robust) FALSIFIED.","birth":"emergence-observation E10 — paradigm-j retry N=30 0.3793 EMERGE 단일 instance robustness 우려; KICK WAVE 3 6/6 design 시 N=60 robustness retest 가설 pre-register","run":"commit 84aa8665 KICK WAVE 3 6/6 paradigm-j N=60 live probe — same prompts pool + 30 추가 sample (N=30→N=60 doubling)","evidence":"N=60 PPR_v3 = 0.2414 (per-seed perfect tie 0.2414/0.2414 across 2 seeds — seed-independent zero variance, sample-size artifact strong signal). gap from 0.25 floor = -0.0086 PARTIAL_NEAR. N=30 0.3793 vs N=60 0.2414 → 0.1379 drift indicates N=30 sample-size positive bias.","falsifiers_triggered":["F-sample-size-1: N=60 PPR_v3 < 0.25 floor → sample-size artifact CONFIRMED. N=60 0.2414 → trigger","F-sample-size-2: per-seed PPR_v3 tie 0.2414/0.2414 (zero variance) seed-independent → sample-size artifact strong signal","F-sample-size-3: N=30 to N=60 PPR_v3 drift > 0.10 (sample-size sensitivity) → robustness 부재 confirmed. drift 0.1379 → trigger"],"falsification_reason":"paradigm-j retry N=30 EMERGE (PPR_v3=0.3793) 는 N=60 robustness retest 시 PARTIAL_NEAR (0.2414) 로 reverted — sample-size artifact false positive 였음. 본 가설 (N=30 EMERGE 가 robust) FALSIFIED. raw#82 retraction-aware: N=30 E